{"data":{"body":"[P3] Delegating the existing two-argument constructor to `super(message, null)` marks the cause as initialized, so callers that previously attached a cause with `initCause()` now receive `IllegalStateException`. Keep the original constructor on `super(message)` and assign its fields directly; retain the new overload for explicit causes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774nnm","finding_digest":"b29aa57998104354b30fbb1d0da75bf9dfb2a76dd9f670ecd0e8a723089ada88","finding_id":"arf_v1_wknkk6mycbbvjmypxmoq3j237h","finding_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-argument-constructor::init-cause-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-argument-constructor::init-cause-compatibility","line":13,"observation_digest":"381ffa7073d2fb3940272bf018413bc7b12b77ad0a63a22877a22c0b8fdf6499","observation_id":"aro_v1_hap7u4dt2l5tsqbhfpybqqj3y6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/exception/UnrecoverableDurableExecutionException.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_wknkk6mycbbvjmypxmoq3j237h","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:00:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5zfolgp3vq7gwoomppogn5kpej","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"f6d734424f8df2dadb2d75fac3942b1a8d883952","reviewer":"codex","start_line":13,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_ryusg2rnhjxdpzf6qieiy5gugs"},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_yi36m3no4ntekjjqgr5eo36273","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:00:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
